     "type": "p",
     "html": "We’re bringing the Lady L vibes to <a href=\"https://preview.convertkit-mail2.com/click/dpheh0hzhm/aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuamVyc2V5Y2l0eXByaWRlLmNvbS8=\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Jersey City Pride Festival</strong></a><strong> on Saturday, August 23rd.</strong> We can’t wait to meet new friends and hopefully see you out there!"
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "Lady L was created for customers who aren’t always seen or represented in traditional cannabis spaces. That means we’ve built our shop to feel welcoming, affirming, and <em>comfortable for everyone</em>. Pride is the perfect time to celebrate that together."
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "Swing by our booth to:"
    },
    {
     "type": "ul",
     "items": [
      "<strong>Meet the Lady L team</strong> &amp; chat with your West Side neighbors",
      "<strong>Snag free swag &amp; merch</strong> (while it lasts!)",
      "<a href=\"https://lab.alpineiq.com/join/c/4688/110028\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Score exclusive specials</strong> for new loyalty members</a>",
      "<strong>Send your friends &amp; Pride Fam</strong> our way for a warm welcome and extra perks"
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "p",
     "html": "Mark your calendar, grab your crew, and come celebrate Pride with us!"
